<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Wednesday it had issued an additional 200 million American-style warrants on Guangdong Investment shares.</p>
<p>Peregrine launched 600 million American-style warrants on the firm on November 26.</p>
<p>Ten warrants represent one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$6.16	 PREMIUM	13.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1298     GEARING	5.05X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 27.NOV.97     PAYDATE	2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p>LISTING HONG KONG MIN EXER LOT 20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$6.55</p>
<p>NOTES: GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
